            <ArticleTitle>Hereditary angioedema and pregnancy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>563-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hereditary Angioedema is a rare but potentially life threatening condition. It is important that Obstetricians are aware of this condition as it affects women in the reproductive years and thus its recognition and proper management in pregnancy is crucial.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
